{"seq":3,"slug":"quantifiers-and-greediness","title":"量词与贪婪模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/regex-fundamentals/quantifiers-and-greediness","wordCount":959,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"量词与贪婪模式\">量词与贪婪模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>量词（Quantifier）控制前一个元素的重复次数，是构建灵活匹配模式的关键。默认情况下所有量词都是<strong>贪婪</strong>的——尽可能多匹配、必要时回溯；在量词后加 <code>?</code> 变为<strong>惰性</strong>（尽可能少匹配），加 <code>+</code> 变为<strong>独占</strong>（匹配后不回溯）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基本量词：<code>*</code>（零或多）、<code>+</code>（一或多）、<code>?</code>（零或一）、<code>{n}</code> / <code>{n,}</code> / <code>{n,m}</code>。</li>\n<li>贪婪、惰性、独占三种模式的区别在于匹配策略与是否允许回溯。</li>\n<li>实践中优先用排除字符类 <code>[^X]*</code> 替代 <code>.*</code>，可同时提升正确性与性能。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"量词概述\">量词概述</h2><p>量词（Quantifier）控制前一个元素的重复次数。正则表达式提供了简写量词和通用量词两种形式，它们是构建灵活匹配模式的关键。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const oneOrMore = /\\d+/;&#10;oneOrMore.exec(&#39;abc123def&#39;);&#10;&#10;const zeroOrMore = /\\d*/;&#10;zeroOrMore.exec(&#39;abc&#39;);&#10;&#10;const optional = /colou?r/;&#10;optional.test(&#39;color&#39;);&#10;optional.test(&#39;colour&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> oneOrMore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">oneOrMore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc123def'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> zeroOrMore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">zeroOrMore.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'abc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> optional</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">colou</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optional.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'color'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optional.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'colour'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量词</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>等价形式</th>\n<th>示例匹配</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>*</code></td>\n<td>零次或多次</td>\n<td><code>{0,}</code></td>\n<td><code>/ab*c/</code> → <code>ac</code>、<code>abbc</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>+</code></td>\n<td>一次或多次</td>\n<td><code>{1,}</code></td>\n<td><code>/ab+c/</code> → <code>abc</code>、<code>abbc</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>?</code></td>\n<td>零次或一次</td>\n<td><code>{0,1}</code></td>\n<td><code>/ab?c/</code> → <code>ac</code>、<code>abc</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{n}</code></td>\n<td>恰好 n 次</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>/a{3}/</code> → <code>aaa</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{n,}</code></td>\n<td>至少 n 次</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>/a{2,}/</code> → <code>aa</code>、<code>aaa</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{n,m}</code></td>\n<td>n 到 m 次</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td><code>/a{2,4}/</code> → <code>aa</code> 到 <code>aaaa</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"贪婪模式\">贪婪模式</h2><p>默认情况下，所有量词都是<strong>贪婪</strong>的——它们会尽可能多地匹配字符，然后在需要时回退（回溯）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const greedy = /&quot;.*&quot;/;&#10;greedy.exec(&#39;&quot;hello&quot; and &quot;world&quot;&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> greedy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">greedy.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'\"hello\" and \"world\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant R as 正则引擎&#10;    participant S as 字符串 &#39;&quot;hello&quot; and &quot;world&quot;&#39;&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;S: .* 贪婪匹配,吞掉所有字符&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;R: 到达字符串末尾&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;S: 回溯,寻找 &quot;&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;R: 找到最后一个 &quot;&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;S: 匹配结果:&quot;hello&quot; and &quot;world&quot;\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant R as 正则引擎\n    participant S as 字符串 '\"hello\" and \"world\"'\n    R-&gt;&gt;S: .* 贪婪匹配,吞掉所有字符\n    S--&gt;&gt;R: 到达字符串末尾\n    R-&gt;&gt;S: 回溯,寻找 \"\n    S--&gt;&gt;R: 找到最后一个 \"\n    R-&gt;&gt;S: 匹配结果:\"hello\" and \"world\"</pre><p>贪婪匹配的结果是 <code>&quot;hello&quot; and &quot;world&quot;</code>，因为 <code>.*</code> 尽可能多地匹配，然后回溯到最后一个 <code>&quot;</code> 停止。</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入字符串</th>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>贪婪结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>&quot;hello&quot; and &quot;world&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;.*&quot;</code></td>\n<td><code>&quot;hello&quot; and &quot;world&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>&lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>&lt;.*&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>&lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>aabab</code></td>\n<td><code>a.*b</code></td>\n<td><code>aabab</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"惰性模式\">惰性模式</h2><p>在量词后添加 <code>?</code> 将其变为<strong>惰性</strong>（非贪婪）模式——尽可能少地匹配字符。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const lazy = /&quot;.*?&quot;/;&#10;lazy.exec(&#39;&quot;hello&quot; and &quot;world&quot;&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lazy</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lazy.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'\"hello\" and \"world\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant R as 正则引擎&#10;    participant S as 字符串 &#39;&quot;hello&quot; and &quot;world&quot;&#39;&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;S: .*? 惰性匹配,先尝试零个字符&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;R: 检查下一个是否为 &quot;&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;S: 不是,扩展一个字符&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;R: 重复扩展直到遇到 &quot;&#10;    R-&gt;&gt;S: 匹配结果:&quot;hello&quot;\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant R as 正则引擎\n    participant S as 字符串 '\"hello\" and \"world\"'\n    R-&gt;&gt;S: .*? 惰性匹配,先尝试零个字符\n    S--&gt;&gt;R: 检查下一个是否为 \"\n    R-&gt;&gt;S: 不是,扩展一个字符\n    S--&gt;&gt;R: 重复扩展直到遇到 \"\n    R-&gt;&gt;S: 匹配结果:\"hello\"</pre><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>贪婪量词</th>\n<th>惰性量词</th>\n<th>行为差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>*</code></td>\n<td><code>*?</code></td>\n<td>尽可能少匹配（零开始）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>+</code></td>\n<td><code>+?</code></td>\n<td>尽可能少匹配（一开始）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>?</code></td>\n<td><code>??</code></td>\n<td>优先不匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>{n,m}</code></td>\n<td><code>{n,m}?</code></td>\n<td>优先匹配 n 次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const html = &#39;&lt;b&gt;bold&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;i&gt;italic&lt;/i&gt;&#39;;&#10;const greedyTag = /&lt;.*&gt;/g;&#10;html.match(greedyTag);&#10;&#10;const lazyTag = /&lt;.*?&gt;/g;&#10;html.match(lazyTag);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> html</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '&#x3C;b>bold&#x3C;/b> and &#x3C;i>italic&#x3C;/i>'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> greedyTag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">html.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(greedyTag);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> lazyTag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">g</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">html.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(lazyTag);</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> 惰性量词并不总是比贪婪量词快。在很多场景下，使用更精确的字符类（如 <code>[^&quot;]*</code> 替代 <code>.*?</code>）比切换贪婪/惰性模式更高效。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"独占量词与原子组\">独占量词与原子组</h2><p><strong>独占量词</strong>（Possessive Quantifier）在匹配后不回溯，匹配失败则直接报告失败。JavaScript 原生不支持独占量词，但可以通过原子组模拟。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import re&#10;pattern = re.compile(r&#39;&quot;[^&quot;]*+&quot;&#39;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> re</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pattern </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> re.compile(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">r</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const atomicLike = /&quot;(?=[^&quot;]*&quot;)[^&quot;]*&quot;/;&#10;&#10;const efficient = /&quot;[^&quot;]*&quot;/;&#10;efficient.exec(&#39;&quot;hello&quot;&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> atomicLike</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"(?=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\")</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> efficient</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">efficient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'\"hello\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三种量词模式的对比：</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n<th>匹配策略</th>\n<th>回溯行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>贪婪</td>\n<td><code>a*</code></td>\n<td>尽可能多匹配</td>\n<td>允许回溯</td>\n<td>默认模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惰性</td>\n<td><code>a*?</code></td>\n<td>尽可能少匹配</td>\n<td>允许回溯</td>\n<td>最短匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独占</td>\n<td><code>a*+</code></td>\n<td>尽可能多匹配</td>\n<td>禁止回溯</td>\n<td>性能优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Q[&quot;量词模式&quot;] --&gt; GREEDY[&quot;贪婪 *&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; LAZY[&quot;惰性 *?&quot;]&#10;    Q --&gt; POSSESSIVE[&quot;独占 *+&quot;]&#10;    GREEDY --&gt; G1[&quot;先吞掉全部&quot;]&#10;    G1 --&gt; G2[&quot;必要时回退&quot;]&#10;    LAZY --&gt; L1[&quot;先匹配最少&quot;]&#10;    L1 --&gt; L2[&quot;必要时扩展&quot;]&#10;    POSSESSIVE --&gt; P1[&quot;吞掉全部&quot;]&#10;    P1 --&gt; P2[&quot;不回退,成败立判&quot;]\">graph TD\n    Q[\"量词模式\"] --&gt; GREEDY[\"贪婪 *\"]\n    Q --&gt; LAZY[\"惰性 *?\"]\n    Q --&gt; POSSESSIVE[\"独占 *+\"]\n    GREEDY --&gt; G1[\"先吞掉全部\"]\n    G1 --&gt; G2[\"必要时回退\"]\n    LAZY --&gt; L1[\"先匹配最少\"]\n    L1 --&gt; L2[\"必要时扩展\"]\n    POSSESSIVE --&gt; P1[\"吞掉全部\"]\n    P1 --&gt; P2[\"不回退,成败立判\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"量词的实际应用\">量词的实际应用</h2><p>合理选择量词模式直接影响匹配的正确性和性能。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const csvField = /([^,]*),/;&#10;csvField.exec(&#39;hello,world,&#39;);&#10;&#10;const quotedField = /&quot;([^&quot;]*)&quot;/;&#10;quotedField.exec(&#39;&quot;hello world&quot;&#39;);&#10;&#10;const repeatingGroup = /(\\d{3}-){2}\\d{4}/;&#10;repeatingGroup.test(&#39;123-456-7890&#39;);&#10;&#10;const ipOctet = /\\b(25[0-5]|2[0-4]\\d|1\\d{2}|[1-9]?\\d)\\b/;&#10;ipOctet.test(&#39;255&#39;);&#10;ipOctet.test(&#39;256&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> csvField</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">,]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">),</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">csvField.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'hello,world,'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> quotedField</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">\"(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">^</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quotedField.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'\"hello world\"'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> repeatingGroup</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{3}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">-)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{4}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">repeatingGroup.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'123-456-7890'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ipOctet</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">(25</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[0-5]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[0-4]\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">{2}|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">[1-9]</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">\\b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ipOctet.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'255'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ipOctet.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">test</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'256'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐模式</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>引号内容提取</td>\n<td><code>&quot;[^&quot;]*&quot;</code></td>\n<td>精确字符类，避免回溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTML 标签匹配</td>\n<td><code>&lt;[^&gt;]*&gt;</code></td>\n<td>比 <code>&lt;.*?&gt;</code> 更高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重复分隔符</td>\n<td><code>(\\d+-){n}</code></td>\n<td>量词作用于分组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可选前后缀</td>\n<td><code>https?://</code></td>\n<td><code>?</code> 处理可选字符</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> 避免在 <code>.*</code> 或 <code>.+</code> 量词两侧使用相同的分隔符（如 <code>&quot;.*&quot;</code>），这是导致贪婪匹配超出预期的最常见原因。优先使用排除字符类 <code>[^X]*</code> 替代。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>要点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本量词</td>\n<td><code>*</code> <code>+</code> <code>?</code> <code>{n}</code> <code>{n,}</code> <code>{n,m}</code></td>\n<td>控制重复次数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贪婪模式</td>\n<td>默认行为</td>\n<td>尽可能多匹配，需要时回溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>惰性模式</td>\n<td>量词后加 <code>?</code></td>\n<td>尽可能少匹配，仍可回溯</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>独占量词</td>\n<td>量词后加 <code>+</code></td>\n<td>不回溯，JS 不原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实战建议</td>\n<td><code>[^X]*</code> 替代 <code>.*</code></td>\n<td>精确字符类优先，避免不必要回溯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>量词</strong>控制匹配重复次数，<code>*</code>（零或多）、<code>+</code>（一或多）、<code>?</code>（零或一）是三个基本量词。</li>\n<li><strong>贪婪模式</strong>（默认）尽可能多地匹配字符，然后通过回溯调整。</li>\n<li><strong>惰性模式</strong>（<code>*?</code>、<code>+?</code>）尽可能少地匹配字符，适用于需要最短匹配的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>独占量词</strong>（<code>*+</code>）匹配后不回溯，可避免灾难性回溯，但 JavaScript 不原生支持。</li>\n<li>实践中优先使用排除字符类 <code>[^X]*</code> 替代通配量词 <code>.*</code>，可同时提升正确性和性能。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"量词与贪婪模式","id":"量词与贪婪模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"量词概述","id":"量词概述"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"贪婪模式","id":"贪婪模式"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"惰性模式","id":"惰性模式"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"独占量词与原子组","id":"独占量词与原子组"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"量词的实际应用","id":"量词的实际应用"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"字符类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/regex-fundamentals/character-classes"},"next":{"title":"锚点与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/regex-fundamentals/anchors-and-boundaries"}}